    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WHAT IT DOES:\n\nTransforms raw sales opportunities into an executive-ready pipeline summary containing total pipeline value, weighted forecast, closed-won revenue, stage distribution, and stalled-deal alerts.\n\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n\nReceives opportunity data through a production webhook, standardizes the input, calculates core sales KPIs, identifies deals stalled for 10 or more days, and returns a structured JSON report.\n\n\nWHY PAY FOR IT: \n\nGives sales leaders immediate pipeline visibility, improves forecasting, and identifies at-risk opportunities without manual spreadsheet calculations.",
